## Getting Started

1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   <%= it.packageManager %> install
   ```

2. Start the development server:
   ```bash
   <%= it.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn' : 'npm run' %> dev
   ```

## Code Quality

Before submitting a PR, make sure all checks pass:

```bash
<%= it.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn' : 'npm run' %> lint
<%= it.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn' : 'npm run' %> format:check
<%= it.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn' : 'npm run' %> test
```

## Commit Convention

We follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/):

- `feat:` new feature
- `fix:` bug fix
- `docs:` documentation changes
- `refactor:` code refactoring
- `test:` adding or updating tests
- `chore:` maintenance tasks

## Branch Naming

- `feat/short-description`
- `fix/short-description`
- `chore/short-description`

## Need Help?

Ask in the team Slack channel or open a Discussion on GitHub.